&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;标题：&lt;/strong&gt;SCP-2197-JP - 每日小期待&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;原文：&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/scp-2197-jp&quot;&gt;http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/scp-2197-jp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;作者：&lt;/strong&gt;©︎&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cat-eyes&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6568589&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609381543&quot; alt=&quot;CAT EYES&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6568589)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cat-eyes&quot;  &gt;CAT EYES&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;翻译：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/katja1453&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6985866&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609381543&quot; alt=&quot;Katja1453&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6985866)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/katja1453&quot;  &gt;Katja1453&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
